«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  TriRightRand
  @  Random draw by inversion: a uniform variate, then TriRightQ.
  @  Stack: Xmin, Xmax
  @  Author & design           : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 2; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 2 == THEN Explode Drop ELSE IF DUP Size 3 == THEN Explode Drop Drop ELSE "TriRightRand: needs 2 arguments" DoError END END END
  → Xminv Xmaxv « Xminv Xmaxv rand ⓁTriRightQ Xminv Xmaxv 2 →List Drop »
»
